SUMMARY:Chris Johnson
LOCATION:Shunk Gulley Oyster Bar\, 1875 S County Hwy 393\, Gulf Place\, FL
DESCRIPTION:Chris Johnson is a vocalist/musician from Memphis\, TN that has
  been singing since 11 years old. He was inspired by the bluesy culture of
  the city and decided to start his music career at a young age. From buski
 ng on the local sidewalks of Memphis\, to playing in big shows in Houston\
 , he has landed in the Gulf Coast aspiring to take his career to the next 
 level. Also be sure to check out his band n…\n\nTimes\, the live map and
  the app: https://30anow.github.io/e/db421f33-d699-4dcc-b210-3bcae2416bca
